    <div class="lg2-author"><div class="lg2-avatar">MS</div><div><h3>Michael Stolzer</h3><div class="role">Managing Editor &amp; Contributor</div><p>Manages and contributes to Liberian Geek, focusing on practical Linux, Ubuntu, Windows, WordPress, and web tutorials for everyday users and administrators.</p><a class="lg2-profile" href="/author/michael_stolzer/">View articles</a></div></div>
    <div class="lg2-author"><div class="lg2-avatar">T</div><div><h3>Talha</h3><div class="role">Technology Writer</div><p>Writes technology tutorials covering practical how-to topics across web tools, software, devices, and productivity workflows.</p><a class="lg2-profile" href="/author/talha/">View articles</a></div></div>
    <div class="lg2-author"><div class="lg2-avatar">AM</div><div><h3>Abdul Moeed</h3><div class="role">Technology Writer</div><p>Writes practical technology tutorials with a focus on clear step-by-step guidance for software, devices, and everyday troubleshooting.</p><a class="lg2-profile" href="/author/moeed/">View articles</a></div></div>
